Clearly, it can be seen that the bankers, although able to settle the matter amicably,
cannot withdraw the complaint or promise to do so, since the offences are non-compoundable;
hence, such clauses are included.

In view, therefore, these Criminal Original Petitions are ordered on the following terms:
(a)The petitioners shall jointly pay the costs of Rs. 30 Lakhs, of which a sum of Rs.15 Lakhs shall be paid to the 1st respondent and another sum of Rs.15 Lakhs shall be paid to the Tamilnadu Mediation and Conciliation Centre, High Court of Madras,
Chennai - 104, within eight weeks of receiving the web copy of the order;

